{"articleNo":"2657","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2657&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 전부(과) 및 전공변경 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.11.18","hit":"13271","attachments":[{"name":"전공변경신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2657&attachNo=2019"},{"name":"전부안내및여석.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2657&attachNo=2407"},{"name":"전부(과)신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2657&attachNo=2409"},{"name":"전공변경안내및여석.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2657&attachNo=2644"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: #3366ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">&nbsp;2011학년도 전부(과) 및 전공변경 신청 안내<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">◆</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">2011학년도 전부(과) 및 전공변경에 관한&nbsp;사항을&nbsp;아래와 같이&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 안내하오니 희망하는 학생</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">들은</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"> 신청하여 주시기 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">바랍니다.<br><br>&nbsp; 가. 신청기간 : <u>2010.11.22(월) ~ 11.26(금)<br></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 나. 신청장소 :&nbsp;전부(과)하고자 하는 해당 종합학사행정실<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 다. 제출서류<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 전부(과) 신청서 또는 전공변경신청서 1부.<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 라. 심사 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 전부(과)하고자 하는 해당학부에서 심사 함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(입학성적 40% + 이수성적 60%)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 마. 기타사항<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">교직과정 이수 예정자가 전부(과) 및 전공변경할 경우 교직과정<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 이수 예정자 선발</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">이 취소됨.<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><br>붙임&nbsp;&nbsp; 전부/전공 변경신청서 각 1부. <br><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2010. 11. 18<br><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">교 무 연 구 과 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
